  "finding_classification": {
    "p40_bucket": "same guarded-dynamic-wrapper/runtime-Protocol class, one level deeper: static isinstance rejects a dynamic proxy even though its call surface delegates through the guard. Widen one generic source-derived member bridge across every audited consumer; do not add consumer-specific proxy checks.",
    "related_patterns": [
      "P31",
      "P32",
      "P38"
    ],
    "property": "A store is admitted to a semantic Core JSON reader or rooted CDC quarantine path only when the source-declared protocol surface is resolvable on the exact handle and the actual operation continues through the guarded handle.",
    "current_divergence": "CoreJSONArtifactStore and IndexedArtifactStore are runtime-checkable Protocols, but isinstance uses statically declared attributes. GuardedDependencyProxy implements dynamic __getattr__, so the current static gate returns false before the actual guarded calls. Separately, CoreToIRArtifactStoreAdapter declares get_raw_manifest_bytes while delegating lazily; its static shape cannot prove its underlying store has that stronger reader."
  },
  "source_contract": {
    "core_protocol": "CoreJSONArtifactStore inherits ArtifactStore and RawManifestBytesReader. Derive public members over the full Protocol MRO; do not copy a member registry.",
    "actual_core_read_order": "core/artifacts/canonical_profile.py:read_core_manifest_profile calls get_raw_manifest_bytes, then get_manifest; read_core_json_artifact calls get_bytes only after selected manifest/profile validation. CoreJSON requires get_raw_manifest_bytes; IR get_manifest_bytes is a distinct adapter surface and is not the Core reader predicate.",
    "indexed_protocol": "fabric/data_plane/quarantine.py:IndexedArtifactStore declares root plus its store methods; streaming uses it only to permit rooted mutable quarantine-index persistence after a breaking CDC schema change.",
    "authority_scope": "No external issuer, institutional appointment, custody, law, permission, or currentness input is consumed or asserted. This bridge makes no authority claim; it preserves existing guarded calls and typed refusal behavior."
  },
  "reuse_options": {
    "selected": "Generalize the existing dynamic member discovery seam in core/artifacts/ir_adapter.py into one generic resolver. Derive requirements from source Protocol classes and inherited bases; resolve attributes dynamically, require callable where the source member is a method, retain annotation/property members as required-present, and use it in the existing adapter path and the audited CoreJSON/IndexedArtifactStore gates. Keep the original GuardedDependencyProxy and selected ArtifactRef unchanged.",
    "alternatives": [
      {
        "option": "Remove or bypass the dependency guard",
        "decision": "reject",
        "reason": "Drops the established timeout/breaker boundary around every CAS operation and changes runtime behavior beyond this structural mismatch."
      },
      {
        "option": "Add static forwarding methods to GuardedDependencyProxy",
        "decision": "defer",
        "reason": "Broadens the generic runtime wrapper contract and duplicates method maintenance; one source-derived resolver addresses all declared Protocol members without coupling the wrapper to each CAS protocol."
      },
      {
        "option": "Patch each CoreJSON/CDC caller or hand-maintain method name lists",
        "decision": "reject",
        "reason": "Repeats the P31 instance ladder and can omit inherited/future Protocol members or sibling callers."
      },
      {
        "option": "Treat CoreToIRArtifactStoreAdapter's static CoreJSON shape as sufficient",
        "decision": "reject",
        "reason": "Its raw-reader method delegates lazily and can conceal a base-only wrapped store. The underlying raw reader must be resolvable; otherwise the actual raw-read stage must refuse before typed manifest/payload access."
      }
    ]
  },
  "invariants_and_migration": [
    "Do not unwrap, replace, mutate, or spoof GuardedDependencyProxy; do not assign __class__ or substitute a Protocol-shaped fake.",
    "Do not change CoreJSON/IndexedArtifactStore declarations or public exports. Keep selected-profile refs/options on the existing APIs.",
    "The source-derived member set includes inherited public callables and public annotated/property members; no local copied list or protocol-name spelling branch at consumers.",
    "An absent required member fails before payload reads. A guard denial on a present method propagates as an operational failure and is never converted to capability absence/default.",
    "The CoreToIR adapter itself is not evidence that its underlying owner exposes raw-manifest bytes. Direct base-only and adapter-over-base-only controls refuse; actual semantic reads still invoke get_raw_manifest_bytes first and validate exact selected sidecar bytes.",
    "IndexedArtifactStore remains tied to the same rooted local CAS/index path already selected by the ingestion service; a missing root/member cannot complete CDC quarantine or silently fall through as success.",
    "No data migration is required. Existing concrete stores remain compatible; dynamic wrappers gain the same existing capability when they forward the complete declared interface."
  ],
